# patches/xlibre-xserver/series: this repo's own patches, applied with
# patch -p1 after nextbsd-xlibre's series (fetched read-only at the commit
# sources.lock pins).
#
#   0001  -Dxnextbsd: build hw/nextbsd (copied in from Xnextbsd/hw/nextbsd)
#         with miext/rootless (nextbsd/apps-xlibre#2).
#   0002  rootless: frames may draw into a pixmap of their own, so that
#         Xnextbsd's frames can be glamor pixmaps (nextbsd/apps-xlibre#10).
#   0003  composite: no copies to or from a rootless root, whose pixmap
#         is a single aliased scanline (glamor read past it: #34).
0001-meson-xnextbsd-option.patch
0002-rootless-frame-pixmaps.patch
0003-composite-rootless-root.patch
